{
  "citekey": "richard2024technoeconomic",
  "apa7": "Richard, S., Ramirez Santos, A., Olivier, P., & Gallucci, F. (2024). Techno-economic analysis of ammonia cracking for large scale power generation. International Journal of Hydrogen Energy, 71, 571-587. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2024.05.308",
  "doi": "10.1016/j.ijhydene.2024.05.308",
